#: src/index.js:113
msgid "Used by Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, Threads, and Reddit. Facebook and LinkedIn read the title from the page Open Graph metadata."
msgstr "Utilizado por Native Share, WhatsApp, correo electrónico, Telegram, X, Bluesky, Threads y Reddit. Facebook y LinkedIn leen el título de la página Open Graph metadata."

#: src/index.js:114
