#: src/index.js:114
msgid "Used by Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, and Threads. Facebook and LinkedIn do not accept a custom message; Reddit uses only the title and URL."
msgstr "Utilizado por Native Share, WhatsApp, correo electrónico, Telegram, X, Bluesky y Threads. Facebook y LinkedIn no aceptan un mensaje personalizado; Reddit utiliza solo el título y la URL."

